# Making Amends (windurst 3): the offer's fame operand. A level-10 WAR at Windurst fame 49 (level 1): not offered;
# Hakkuru-Rinkuru's script (nothing) and his default 224. Fame 50: 274, options 0 and 2 (not 1: nothing).
lists PortWindurst/Hakkuru-Rinkuru/onTrigger
char zone=PortWindurst pos=-109.1,-4.25,102.06 job=WAR lvl=10
fame Windurst 49
login
trigger Hakkuru-Rinkuru+7                     # fame level 1: not offered; 224
finish
fame Windurst 50
trigger Hakkuru-Rinkuru+7                     # 274
finish option=0
trigger Hakkuru-Rinkuru+7                     # 274
finish option=2                               # not 1: nothing
